/* Controversies */The photo included in the controversies section was incorrect. The photo alleged that Tom ordered police to tear gas the protestors when in reality, this is a baseless accusation. This is wrong in multiple ways: 

-The police shown in the photo are Lake County police whom Mayor Tom has no influence over. Mayor Tom later received treatments for effects of tear gas later that day due to the actions in the photo. 
-Mayor Tom and protestors were both caught in a blast of paper...
